window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Still reeling from betrayal, my heart battles its own scars as I return to the ruthless Conservatory.</b></p> <p>No closer to discovering the truth of my origins and with the rivalry against Arcanum Citadel intensifying, each deadly trial pushes me closer to mastering my mysterious powers, but at a steep cost.</p> <p>To survive, I must do the unthinkable: team up with the enemy. Reluctantly, I form an alliance with a rival student, and together we uncover a sinister plot that threatens our academy and the entire realm. A powerful, unforeseen adversary looms, intent on plunging us into chaos.</p> <p>As whispers of war echo through the halls, the fragile peace between the courts teeters on the edge. Amidst this turmoil, I grapple with new feelings for an unlikely ally and my lingering obsession with my forbidden professor, each stolen moment with him a painful reminder of his deception.</p> <p>With the fate of the realm in my hands, I must choose: unite the courts against this new enemy or let conflict consume us all. In a world where light and shadow collide, only the strongest will prevail, and the secrets I uncover may be our key to survival—or our undoing.</p> <p><i>This epic fantasy romance series contains steamy, enemies to lovers, touch her and I'll unalive you vibes, an age gap, and a smoldering slow-burn student/teacher relationship. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
